{title: Ei Bhalo Ei Kharap}
{artist: Arijit Singh Monali Thakur}
{key: D}

{c: Verse 1}
[D]Ei bhalo ei [Bm]kharap,        [G]Prem mane mishti [D]paak
Cholo [G]maane maane diye feli [Em]dub,        Tumi ami [D]mile
[D]Dujoei [Bm]montake,        [G]Bendhe feli saat [D]pake
Cholo [G]choto khato kori vul [Em]chuk,        Tumi ami [D]mile
Sajiyechi [G]chotto ek fali [Em]sukh,        Raji achi [Bm]ajke brishti [D]namuk
Tumi ami [Em]vijbo dujone [A]khub,        Vorsa [G]dile... [D]hmmm
[Bm]Dekho na ei [D]okal shrabon,        [G]Nemeche aaj [Bm]haajar baron [D]jene... [A]
[Bm]Awaz shune [D]amay dako,        [G]Dako chador [Bm]aamar kache [D]ene... [A]
Ronge ronge [G]voriye diyechi [Em]ghor,        Vije gechi [Bm]brishti namar [D]por
Tumi ami [Em]ghor thekeo [A]jajabor,        Jacchi [G]chole... [D]hmmm
